  Difficulties:
  - Name: Delver
    Description: A gentle descent. Enemies have 25% less health, and the tougher
      creatures arrive a little later.
    HealthMultiplier: 0.75
    EnemyUnlockShift: -2
    TougherEnemyBias: 0
  - Name: Warden
    Description: The dungeon as intended. Enemies come at full strength, and new
      creatures appear on schedule.
    HealthMultiplier: 1
    EnemyUnlockShift: 0
    TougherEnemyBias: 0
  - Name: Overseer
    Description: For seasoned keepers. Enemies have 35% more health, and tougher
      creatures arrive 3 waves early and make up more of each wave.
    HealthMultiplier: 1.35
    EnemyUnlockShift: 3
    TougherEnemyBias: 0.5
  - Name: Abyssal
    Description: The deep wakes. Enemies have 80% more health, and the worst creatures
      crawl out 6 waves early and swarm every wave.
    HealthMultiplier: 1.8
    EnemyUnlockShift: 6
    TougherEnemyBias: 1
